94	seed5 & 10 & G & 29.10 & [22.1, 37.3] & $p{<}0.001$ \\
95	seed6 & 15 & G & 29.10 & [22.1, 37.3] & $p{<}0.001$ \\
96	seed4 & 15 & G & 30.60 & [23.5, 38.7] & $p{<}0.001$ \\
